<item>
            <title>[LU-19575] sanity-pcc: returned 32 - umount: /mnt/pcc.d24a.sanity-pcc: target is busy</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19575</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Marc Vef &amp;lt;mvef@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/b6f3af7d-39fc-4bee-9ee4-202b01948586&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/b6f3af7d-39fc-4bee-9ee4-202b01948586&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_24a failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;test_24a returned 32
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/118248&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/118248&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.76.1.el8_10.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/118248&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/118248&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.76.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Cleanup PCC backend on /mnt/lustre
CMD: trevis-73vm2 /usr/sbin/lctl pcc clear /mnt/lustre
CMD: trevis-73vm2 pkill --pidfile=/var/run/lhsmtool_posix.pid --signal=TERM hsmtool
CMD: trevis-73vm2 rm -rf /mnt/pcc.d24a.sanity-pcc/d24a.sanity-pcc
CMD: trevis-73vm2 lsof /mnt/pcc.d24a.sanity-pcc
pdsh@trevis-73vm1: trevis-73vm2: ssh exited with exit code 1
/mnt/pcc.d24a.sanity-pcc is idle now
CMD: trevis-73vm2 umount -d /mnt/pcc.d24a.sanity-pcc
trevis-73vm2: umount: /mnt/pcc.d24a.sanity-pcc: target is busy.
pdsh@trevis-73vm1: trevis-73vm2: ssh exited with exit code 32
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;







&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
sanity-pcc test_24a - test_24a returned 32&lt;/p&gt;</description>
