Current Patch Set: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Commit: a55a6258740028b2e9436588ce00952ca48a3b1a&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="500947" author="JIRAUSER19288" created="Fri, 4 Sep 2026 09:18:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ll fold all duplicate LU tickets into this umbrella ticket, which has the fix patch. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As mentioned, the failing function is shared by many tests in sanity-pcc, which resulted in several duplicate tickets&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
